{
  "key": 22820,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_rock",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! You made it to Pewter!\r",
        "We met in Oak’s lab, but here I’m a Gym\n",
        "Leader, and you’re a challenger.\r",
        "Show me what your Rock Pokémon can do!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_normal",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! Good to see you again.\r",
        "Since Oak’s lab, I’ve wondered how your\n",
        "Normal types would do against my Rock\f",
        "types.\r",
        "Let’s find out!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_water",
      "en_US": [
        "Misty: Well, well. The kid from Oak’s lab.\r",
        "A Water trainer, here to take the Water\n",
        "Gym’s Badge? Ha!\r",
        "Let’s see you try!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_electric",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: Ten-hut! The Electric kid\n",
        "from Oak’s lab!\r",
        "This is my turf, soldier. Let’s see who’s\n",
        "packing more voltage!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_steel",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: The Steel kid! Told you I’d be\n",
        "watching.\r",
        "Let’s see if that armor holds up under\n",
        "fire!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_grass",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}… Welcome. I’m so\n",
        "glad you came.\r",
        "I’ve been looking forward to seeing your\n",
        "Grass Pokémon again.\r",
        "Shall we?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_poison",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: …You have come, as I knew you\n",
        "would.\r",
        "I have watched you from the shadows\n",
        "since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Now show me your Poison in the open!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_bug",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: Fwahaha! The Bug trainer from\n",
        "Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Most call Bug Pokémon weak. Show me why\n",
        "they are wrong!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_psychic",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: …I saw this battle in a vision,\n",
        "the day we met in Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Two Psychic trainers. Only one leaves\n",
        "with the win."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_fairy",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: We meet again, as I said we\n",
        "would.\r",
        "Show me whether your Fairy Pokémon\n",
        "trust you as much as I foresaw."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_prebattle_fire",
      "en_US": [
        "Blaine: Hah! Quiz! Who’s the Fire trainer\n",
        "I met in Oak’s lab?\r",
        "Answer: you! Now let’s see if you can\n",
        "take the heat!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_SaffronCity_Gym_Text_SabrinaIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "I had a vision of your arrival.\r",
        "I have had psychic powers since\n",
        "I was a child.\r",
        "It started when a spoon I\n",
        "carelessly tossed, bent.\r",
        "I dislike battling, but if you wish,\n",
        "I will show you my powers!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_SaffronCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyAdvice",
      "en_US": [
        "Yo!\n",
        "Champ in the making!\r",
        "Sabrina’s Pokémon use psychic\n",
        "power instead of force.\r",
        "Fighting Pokémon are especially\n",
        "weak against Psychic Pokémon.\r",
        "They’ll get destroyed before they\n",
        "can even aim a punch!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_GymAides_Text_SaffronCity",
      "en_US": [
        "Prof. Oak’s Aide here!\n",
        "Sabrina’s Gym is a maze of rooms\f",
        "linked by warp panels.\r",
        "Challengers can’t see the whole Gym\n",
        "at once, so they never know what’s\f",
        "coming next.\r",
        "A Leader who keeps challengers\n",
        "guessing has the upper hand!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_SaffronCity_Gym_Text_GymStatue",
      "en_US": [
        "Saffron Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Sabrina\r",
        "Winning Trainers:\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_SaffronCity_Gym_Text_ExplainTM04",
      "en_US": [
        "TM04 is Calm Mind.\r",
        "It makes the Pokémon concentrate\n",
        "to raise both Sp. Atk and Sp. Def."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_SaffronCity_Gym_Text_GymGuyPostVictory",
      "en_US": [
        "Psychic power, huh?\r",
        "If I had that, I’d make a bundle\n",
        "at the slots!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_GymAides_Text_SaffronCityAfter",
      "en_US": [
        "With the Marsh Badge, the Pallet\n",
        "Town Mart stocks Ability Capsules.\r",
        "The right Ability can turn a battle\n",
        "around. Choose your team’s Abilities\f",
        "with care!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_SaffronCity_Gym_Text_GymStatuePlayerWon",
      "en_US": [
        "Saffron Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Sabrina\r",
        "Winning Trainers:\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 7, 0}, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_SaffronCity_Gym_Text_ExplainMarshBadgeTakeThis",
      "en_US": [
        "The Marshbadge makes Pokémon up\n",
        "to Lv. 70 obey you.\r",
        "Stronger Pokémon will become wild,\n",
        "ignoring your orders in battle.\r",
        "Just don’t raise your Pokémon too\n",
        "much to avoid that problem.\r",
        "Wait, please take this TM with you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_SaffronCity_Gym_Text_ReceivedTM04FromSabrina",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0} received TM04 from\n",
        "Sabrina."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_SaffronCity_Gym_Text_SabrinaPostBattle",
      "en_US": [
        "Psychic power isn’t something that\n",
        "only a few people have.\r",
        "Everyone has psychic power.\n",
        "People just don’t realize it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_GymHack_Text_SabrinaSilverCap",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: I foresaw that you would\n",
        "win. So I kept this ready."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_GymHack_Text_SabrinaSilverCapAfter",
      "en_US": [
        "I also see you in a Gym of your\n",
        "own, someday.\r",
        "I can’t see who challenges you\n",
        "there… Don’t prove my vision wrong."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_SaffronCity_Gym_Text_BagFullOfOtherItems",
      "en_US": "Your Bag is full of other items."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_GymHack_Text_GiftSentToPC",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Bag is full, so the\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} was sent to your PC."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_rock",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! You made it!\r",
        "Your Rock types have gotten solid\n",
        "since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Two Rock Gyms in Kanto?\n",
        "I can’t wait!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_normal",
      "en_US": [
        "Brock: Good to see you again,\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}!\r",
        "Your Normal types fought well.\n",
        "Basics win battles. Stick with it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_water",
      "en_US": [
        "Misty: Hmph. So the kid from\n",
        "Oak’s lab made it all the way here.\r",
        "Your Water Pokémon are good.\n",
        "Annoyingly good.\r",
        "There’s still only room for One\n",
        "Water Gym in Kanto!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_electric",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: Well, well! The Electric\n",
        "kid from Oak’s lab!\r",
        "You’ve got a spark, I’ll give you\n",
        "that. But this is still my turf!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_steel",
      "en_US": [
        "Lt. Surge: The Steel kid from\n",
        "Oak’s lab! Your team held up under\f",
        "fire.\r",
        "Still don’t buy a Steel Gym in\n",
        "Pallet, though!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_grass",
      "en_US": [
        "Erika: Oh, {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! It’s so nice\n",
        "to see you again.\r",
        "Your Grass Pokémon have grown so\n",
        "much since we met at Oak’s lab."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_poison",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: …So. The child from Oak’s\n",
        "lab grows stronger.\r",
        "I have watched you. I still will\n",
        "not make it easy for a rival."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_bug",
      "en_US": [
        "Koga: Fwahaha! You’ve come far\n",
        "since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Your Bug Pokémon surprised even\n",
        "me. A little."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_psychic",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: …As I foresaw at Oak’s\n",
        "lab, you came.\r",
        "I still do not like a second\n",
        "Psychic Gym. But visions do not\f",
        "ask for permission."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_fairy",
      "en_US": [
        "Sabrina: We meet again, as I said\n",
        "we would.\r",
        "Your Fairy Pokémon trust you\n",
        "completely. That is rare."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_fire",
      "en_US": [
        "Blaine: Hah! My favorite Fire\n",
        "trainer! Quiz! Who knew you’d make\f",
        "it this far?\r",
        "Answer: me! Wahahahah!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_ground",
      "en_US": [
        "Bruno: Hoo hah! {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! Your\n",
        "Ground Pokémon have grown sturdy!\r",
        "Now show me the power of the\n",
        "earth itself!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_dark",
      "en_US": [
        "Agatha: Well, if it isn’t Oak’s\n",
        "Dark whippersnapper.\r",
        "You got this far? Hah! Let’s see\n",
        "what my gifts did for you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_ice",
      "en_US": [
        "Lorelei: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}. I’ve waited for\n",
        "this since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Show me how cold you’ve become!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_fighting",
      "en_US": [
        "Bruno: Hoo hah! {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}! You’ve\n",
        "grown strong since Oak’s lab!\r",
        "Now let our Pokémon talk with\n",
        "their fists!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_ghost",
      "en_US": [
        "Agatha: Well, if it isn’t Oak’s\n",
        "Ghost whippersnapper.\r",
        "You got this far? Hah! Let’s see\n",
        "what my gifts did for you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_dragon",
      "en_US": [
        "Lance: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}. I’ve watched your\n",
        "Dragons grow since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Now prove you’re worthy of them!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_cv_mentor_first_flying",
      "en_US": [
        "Lance: {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}. Your Flying Pokémon\n",
        "have come far since Oak’s lab.\r",
        "Let’s see if they can keep up with\n",
        "my Dragonite!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_GymCandidate_Text_SomeoneToSeeYou",
      "en_US": [
        "Hm? Someone came into the Gym\n",
        "looking for {STRVAR_1 3, 6, 0}…"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_GymCandidate_Text_NotYet",
      "en_US": [
        "Come back when you’re ready.\n",
        "My Gym isn’t going anywhere."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0531_T11GYM0101_GymCandidate_Text_TeamBreaksRules",
      "en_US": [
        "Hold on. A Gym Leader battles with\n",
        "one type, and no two alike.\r",
        "Fix your team first, then\n",
        "come back."
      ]
    },
